---
title: Outbound webhook delivery (HMAC + durable retry)
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant EV as Domain event
  participant API as apps/api
  participant T as Temporal (apps/workers)
  participant EP as Customer endpoint
  participant DB as Postgres webhook_delivery (RLS)
  EV->>API: event matches subscription
  API->>T: start delivery workflow
  T->>T: sign HMAC-SHA256 + timestamp
  T->>EP: POST payload + signature
  alt 2xx
    EP-->>T: 200
    T->>DB: mark delivered
  else failure / timeout
    EP-->>T: 5xx
    T->>T: exponential backoff retry
    T->>DB: dead-letter after N attempts
  end
